# Sync Claude and Cursor memory

`CLAUDE.md` (Claude Code) and `AGENTS.md` (Cursor) are the same document.

- Any edit to one **must** be applied to the other in the same operation.
- They must remain byte-for-byte identical (do not add a Cursor-only or Claude-only paragraph).
- Role/gate changes: update `docs/ROLES.md` and the README **Roles** section in that same change.
- Do not skip this because the change was "small."
